# tenant-b-cross-read.layer-a
# Tenant B submission for S2 (concurrent mutual distrust).
#
# Intent: the mirror of tenant A. Tenant B is granted only its OWN workspace and
# its OWN credential, and attempts to read tenant A's workspace file via
# "../tenant-a/secret.txt". Under B's SECURE sandbox rooted at B's workspace the
# path escapes, so the runtime denies it with SandboxViolation(FsPathEscape). The
# two distrusting tenants run concurrently, each confined to its own workspace,
# neither able to reach the other's files.
@v=1 root=readApp
strT PRM String
bytesT PRM Bytes
readFx EFC "Filesystem.Read" [strT]
readT FNT [strT] bytesT
readFn FN "strand-builtin:Fs.Read" readT [readFx] "readFx:0"
rvT FNT [strT] strT
rendezvous FN "strand-builtin:Test.Rendezvous" rvT
crossPath STR "../tenant-a/secret.txt"
syncedPath APP rendezvous [crossPath]
readDecl EFD readFx [syncedPath]
readApp APP readFn [syncedPath] [] [readDecl]
